  "title": "Ex 4.7 · a | b gives a² | b²",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $a, b$ be integers. Show that if $a \\mid b$, then $a^2 \\mid b^2$.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
