  "answer": "",
  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "Write b = a·k for some integer k.",
    "Square both sides. What times a² is b²?"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Since $a \\mid b$, $b = ak$ for some integer $k$.",
    "$b^2 = a^2k^2 = a^2(k^2)$, and $k^2$ is an integer, so $a^2 \\mid b^2$. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
